  "description": "MediatR integration for Vali-Validation. Targets net7.0/net8.0/net9.0/net10.0. Adds a\n            ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse> pipeline behavior that automatically\n            validates IRequest objects using Vali-Validation before they reach their handler.\n            Throws ValidationException on failure. Pinned to MediatR 12.4.1 (the last fully\n            Apache-licensed release) so installing this package never pulls in MediatR's\n            commercial license requirement. Use Vali-Validation.ValiMediator instead if you use\n            Vali-Mediator — it provides richer integration with Result<T> support (no\n            exceptions needed) and stays free.",
  "iconFile": "VV.png",
